      "comment": "PENNY PINCHER (1) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from four starts. Missed the frame latest (16.76) when fourth over 275m at this track in a Grade 5/6. Looks suited here and rates on top. FEARLESS PARKER (8) collided with another runner and finished a well held 6 lengths second (17.65) last time in a Grade 5 at Northam over 297m. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. QUEEN POTATO (2) was well in the market last time but only managed fourth (16.73), beaten 3.5 lengths. Finished third the start before. Expected to give a good account. KATITJIN (3) cannot be left out after placing here at this trip last start.",
